{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function safeRandomUUID(): string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/utils/uuid.ts#L11","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/utils/uuid.ts:11"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns a RFC 4122 version 4 UUID."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prefers "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"crypto.randomUUID()"},{"type":"text","value":" when available. In non-secure browser contexts\n(e.g. a dev server accessed via a LAN IP over HTTP) "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"crypto.randomUUID"},{"type":"text","value":" is\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":", so this falls back to building a UUIDv4 from\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"crypto.getRandomValues"},{"type":"text","value":". Throws if neither API is available."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See https://github.com/TanStack/db/issues/1541."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction safeRandomUUID(): string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/utils/uuid.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/utils/uuid.ts#L11)\n\nReturns a RFC 4122 version 4 UUID.\n\nPrefers `crypto.randomUUID()` when available. In non-secure browser contexts\n(e.g. a dev server accessed via a LAN IP over HTTP) `crypto.randomUUID` is\n`undefined`, so this falls back to building a UUIDv4 from\n`crypto.getRandomValues`. Throws if neither API is available.\n\nSee https://github.com/TanStack/db/issues/1541.\n\n## Returns\n\n`string`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: safeRandomUUID\ntitle: safeRandomUUID\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction safeRandomUUID(): string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/utils/uuid.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/utils/uuid.ts#L11)\n\nReturns a RFC 4122 version 4 UUID.\n\nPrefers `crypto.randomUUID()` when available. In non-secure browser contexts\n(e.g. a dev server accessed via a LAN IP over HTTP) `crypto.randomUUID` is\n`undefined`, so this falls back to building a UUIDv4 from\n`crypto.getRandomValues`. Throws if neither API is available.\n\nSee https://github.com/TanStack/db/issues/1541.\n\n## Returns\n\n`string`\n"}
